---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Metodología — MadridVerde" description="Fórmula del Índice Verde: 14 datasets, 5 sub-índices, pesos, normalización y fuentes de datos">
  <section class="methodology">
    <h1 data-i18n="methodology.title">Metodología</h1>
    <p class="methodology-subtitle" data-i18n="methodology.subtitle">Transparencia total: cómo se calcula el Índice Verde</p>

    <!-- Formula -->
    <div class="formula-card">
      <h2 data-i18n="methodology.formulaTitle">Índice Verde (0-100)</h2>
      <p class="formula" data-i18n="methodology.formula">IV = Aire x 0.30 + Verde x 0.25 + Ruido x 0.20 + Movilidad x 0.15 + Reciclaje x 0.10</p>
      <p class="formula-note" data-i18n="methodology.formulaNote">Cada sub-índice está normalizado a escala 0-100. Mayor puntuación = mejor calidad ambiental.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sub-indices detail -->
    <div class="subindex-grid">
      <div class="subindex-card">
        <div class="subindex-header">
          <h3 data-i18n="methodology.aireTitle">Aire</h3>
          <span class="subindex-weight">30%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subindex-method" data-i18n="methodology.aireMethod">Media inversa de ratios contaminante/límite para NO2, PM2.5, PM10 y O3. Datos en tiempo real cada 20 minutos.</p>
        <div class="subindex-sources">
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.aireBadge1">API ciudadesabiertas</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.aireBadge2">24 estaciones</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.aireBadge3">4 contaminantes</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subindex-limits" data-i18n="methodology.aireLimits">Límites OMS: NO2 40 ug/m3, PM2.5 25 ug/m3, PM10 40 ug/m3, O3 120 ug/m3</p>
      </div>

      <div class="subindex-card">
        <div class="subindex-header">
          <h3 data-i18n="methodology.verdeTitle">Verde</h3>
          <span class="subindex-weight">25%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subindex-method" data-i18n="methodology.verdeMethod">Combinación de m2 de zonas verdes por habitante (70%) y árboles por 1.000 habitantes (30%). OMS recomienda mínimo 9 m2/hab.</p>
        <div class="subindex-sources">
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.verdeBadge1">Arbolado XLSX (793K árboles)</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.verdeBadge2">Zonas verdes por distrito</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.verdeBadge3">Padrón 2025</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subindex-card">
        <div class="subindex-header">
          <h3 data-i18n="methodology.ruidoTitle">Ruido</h3>
          <span class="subindex-weight">20%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subindex-method" data-i18n="methodology.ruidoMethod">Escala inversa del nivel LAeq medio de las estaciones acústicas SIVCA del distrito. OMS recomienda no superar 55 dB en zonas residenciales.</p>
        <div class="subindex-sources">
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.ruidoBadge1">37 estaciones SIVCA</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.ruidoBadge2">Serie histórica 1998-2025</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.ruidoBadge3">LAeq, Ld, Ln</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subindex-card">
        <div class="subindex-header">
          <h3 data-i18n="methodology.movilidadTitle">Movilidad</h3>
          <span class="subindex-weight">15%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subindex-method" data-i18n="methodology.movilidadMethod">Estimación neutra (50/100) pendiente de integrar datos de carriles bici, BiciMAD e intensidad de tráfico en tiempo real.</p>
        <div class="subindex-sources">
          <span class="source-badge source-badge--pending" data-i18n="methodology.movilidadBadge1">Tráfico XML (pendiente)</span>
          <span class="source-badge source-badge--pending" data-i18n="methodology.movilidadBadge2">BiciMAD (pendiente)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subindex-card">
        <div class="subindex-header">
          <h3 data-i18n="methodology.reciclajeTitle">Reciclaje</h3>
          <span class="subindex-weight">10%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subindex-method" data-i18n="methodology.reciclajeMethod">Contenedores de reciclaje por cada 1.000 habitantes del distrito, normalizado sobre el rango observado (4-25/1.000 hab).</p>
        <div class="subindex-sources">
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.reciclajeBadge1">44.251 contenedores</span>
          <span class="source-badge" data-i18n="methodology.reciclajeBadge2">4 tipos (papel, vidrio, orgánica, envases)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data flow diagram -->
    <h2 data-i18n="methodology.dataFlowTitle">Flujo de datos</h2>
    <div class="data-flow">
      <div class="flow-column">
        <h3 data-i18n="methodology.dataFlow14Sources">14 fuentes de datos</h3>
        <ul class="source-list">
          <li class="source-item source-item--rt" data-i18n="methodology.dfAirRealtime">Calidad aire real-time (JSON)</li>
          <li class="source-item source-item--rt" data-i18n="methodology.dfAir30Days">Calidad aire 30 días (JSON)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfAirStationsCSV">Estaciones calidad aire (CSV)</li>
          <li class="source-item source-item--rt" data-i18n="methodology.dfTrafficRealtime">Tráfico real-time (XML)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfTrafficSensors">Puntos medida tráfico (CSV)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfParksJSONLD">Parques y jardines (JSON-LD)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfNoiseStationsCSV">Estaciones acústicas (CSV)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfRecyclingCSV">Contenedores reciclaje (CSV)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfDistrictsTopo">Límites distritos (TopoJSON)</li>
          <li class="source-item" data-i18n="methodology.dfNeighborhoodsTopo">Límites barrios (TopoJSON)</li>
          <li class="source-item source-item--build" data-i18n="methodology.dfTreesXLSX">Arbolado 793K árboles (XLSX)</li>
          <li class="source-item source-item--build" data-i18n="methodology.dfTreesAreaCSV">Arbolado superficie (CSV)</li>
          <li class="source-item source-item--build" data-i18n="methodology.dfNoiseHistorical">Ruido histórico 1998+ (CSV)</li>
          <li class="source-item source-item--build" data-i18n="methodology.dfDemographicsCSV">Indicadores sociodemográficos (CSV)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">-></div>
      <div class="flow-column">
        <h3 data-i18n="methodology.dataFlowProcessing">Procesamiento</h3>
        <ul class="process-list">
          <li><strong data-i18n="methodology.dfBuildTime">Build-time:</strong> <span data-i18n="methodology.dfBuildTimeDesc">XLSX/CSV pesados -> JSON pequenos</span></li>
          <li><strong data-i18n="methodology.dfRuntime">Runtime:</strong> <span data-i18n="methodology.dfRuntimeDesc">APIs real-time -> cache 20 min</span></li>
          <li><strong data-i18n="methodology.dfNormalization">Normalización:</strong> <span data-i18n="methodology.dfNormalizationDesc">Escala lineal 0-100</span></li>
          <li><strong data-i18n="methodology.dfWeighting">Ponderación:</strong> <span data-i18n="methodology.dfWeightingDesc">5 sub-índices x pesos</span></li>
          <li><strong data-i18n="methodology.dfTiers">Tiers:</strong> <span data-i18n="methodology.dfTiersDesc">Excelente -> Crítico</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">-></div>
      <div class="flow-column">
        <h3 data-i18n="methodology.dataFlowResult">Resultado</h3>
        <ul class="result-list">
          <li data-i18n="methodology.dfResultIndex">Índice Verde por distrito (0-100)</li>
          <li data-i18n="methodology.dfResultMap">Mapa choropleth interactivo</li>
          <li data-i18n="methodology.dfResultScorecard">Scorecard con 5 sub-índices</li>
          <li data-i18n="methodology.dfResultRadar">Comparador radar chart</li>
          <li data-i18n="methodology.dfResultTrends">Tendencias históricas</li>
          <li data-i18n="methodology.dfResultPhrases">Frases contextuales</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tiers -->
    <h2 data-i18n="methodology.classificationTitle">Clasificación</h2>
    <div class="tiers">
      <div class="tier" style="--tier-color: #2D6A4F"><span class="tier-range">85-100</span><span class="tier-name" data-i18n="tier.excellent">Excelente</span><span class="tier-desc" data-i18n="methodology.tierExcellentDesc">Pulmones de la ciudad</span></div>
      <div class="tier" style="--tier-color: #52B788"><span class="tier-range">70-84</span><span class="tier-name" data-i18n="tier.good">Bueno</span><span class="tier-desc" data-i18n="methodology.tierGoodDesc">Respira bien</span></div>
      <div class="tier" style="--tier-color: #E9C46A"><span class="tier-range">55-69</span><span class="tier-name" data-i18n="tier.acceptable">Aceptable</span><span class="tier-desc" data-i18n="methodology.tierAcceptableDesc">Margen de mejora</span></div>
      <div class="tier" style="--tier-color: #F4A261"><span class="tier-range">40-54</span><span class="tier-name" data-i18n="tier.improvable">Mejorable</span><span class="tier-desc" data-i18n="methodology.tierImprovableDesc">Necesita atención</span></div>
      <div class="tier" style="--tier-color: #E76F51"><span class="tier-range">0-39</span><span class="tier-name" data-i18n="tier.critical">Crítico</span><span class="tier-desc" data-i18n="methodology.tierCriticalDesc">Zona crítica</span></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <h2 data-i18n="methodology.sourcesTitle">Fuentes</h2>
    <p class="sources-note"><span data-i18n="methodology.sourcesNote">Todos los datos proceden de</span> <a href="https://datos.madrid.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener">datos.madrid.es</a> <span data-i18n="methodology.sourcesAnd">y</span> <a href="https://ciudadesabiertas.madrid.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ciudadesabiertas.madrid.es</a><span data-i18n="methodology.sourcesEnd">, portales oficiales del Ayuntamiento de Madrid. Los datos se actualizan automáticamente según la frecuencia de cada fuente.</span></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  if (window.__mvAnalytics) {
    window.__mvAnalytics('page_viewed', { page_type: 'methodology' });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .methodology {
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .methodology h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    color: var(--color-bosque);
  }

  .methodology-subtitle {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .methodology h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Formula */
  .formula-card {
    background: var(--color-bosque);
    color: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .formula-card h2 {
    color: white;
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .formula {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .formula-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Sub-index cards */
  .subindex-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .subindex-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .subindex-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .subindex-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .subindex-weight {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-bosque);
  }

  .subindex-method {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .subindex-sources {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .source-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.08);
    color: var(--color-bosque);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .source-badge--pending {
    background: rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.15);
    color: var(--color-arcilla);
  }

  .subindex-limits {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-piedra);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Data flow */
  .data-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .flow-column {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .flow-column h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-hoja);
    align-self: center;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .source-list, .process-list, .result-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .source-item {
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }

  .source-item--rt::before { content: '⚡ '; }
  .source-item--build::before { content: '🔧 '; }

  .process-list li, .result-list li {
    padding: 3px 0;
  }

  /* Tiers */
  .tiers {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tier {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 150px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tier-range {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--tier-color);
    display: block;
  }

  .tier-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .tier-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-piedra);
    font-style: italic;
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  /* Sources */
  .sources-note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .sources-note a {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .methodology {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
    .data-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .flow-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .tiers {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .formula {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
